  "body": "## Summary\n- Pick hints name the platform command key: edge hint and Click selects hover (geo_page.rs), boundary picking hint (boundary.rs), code comments (boundary_draft.rs, shell.rs).\n- Docs: site/content/guide/first-run.md undo/redo line names Cmd+Z / Cmd+Y on macOS. No pick-gesture page exists on main, so none was edited.\n- Helper: none on main (PR #1293 not merged), so minimal local wording \"Ctrl (Cmd on macOS)\" / \"Cmd+click on macOS\". #1293 can unify it.\n\n## Fork\nFork synced at v0.18.0 (branch from upstream/main beb9e5b9).\n\n## Tests\n- Pinned by pick_hints_name_the_platform_command_key (crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/structural.rs). No snapshot PNG changed.\n- Quick gate: ui lib + boundary, boundary_picks, theme_files - ok. clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -D warnings - clean.\n- zola 0.23.6 build of site/ - ok.\n\n## Not exercised\n- No macOS run; no visual check of the hover text.\n- Fork process files (PROCESS_VERSION 31 vs upstream 35) not synced on the fork's main this session; branch is from upstream/main, which carries 35.\n\nChangelog: Pick hints and the first-run undo/redo line name the Cmd key on macOS (#1238)\n\nFixes #1238\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
